docs {
  # Hibah Internal API
  
  CRUD endpoints untuk manajemen hibah internal.
  
  ## Base URL
  `/api/hibah-internal`
  
  ## Endpoints Overview
  
  | Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role | Description |
  |--------|----------|------|------|-------------|
  | GET | / | ❌ | Public | List hibah internal |
  | GET | /:id | ❌ | Public | Get by ID |
  | POST | / | ✅ | Admin | Create hibah |
  | PUT | /:id | ✅ | Admin | Update hibah |
  | DELETE | /:id | ✅ | Admin | Delete hibah |
  
  ## Tipe Hibah
  - Penelitian
  - Pengabdian
}
